{"unit_id":"emuco__dsh-venv#card-zh","repo":"emuco/dsh-venv","commit":"5b1b7bbf1a9f3c39be775db7e7d6883ec4461e57","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-venv 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的项目运行环境插件。它通过 DSH 工具和系统提示接入工作流，并在设置页提供项目环境面板。插件可检查并接管项目已有的 Python venv，在缺少环境时创建 .venv_local/python；也能在项目环境中运行命令，将 python 和 pip 指向项目解释器，并根据项目标记文件识别 Python、Node 和 Go 运行时、配置相应环境变量。适合希望隔离各项目 Python 依赖并查看工作区环境状态的开发者。使用需有可用 Python 解释器，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:106-194","src/index.js:159-201","src/index.js:215-250"]}
{"unit_id":"emuco__dsh-venv#card-en","repo":"emuco/dsh-venv","commit":"5b1b7bbf1a9f3c39be775db7e7d6883ec4461e57","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-venv adds DSH tools and a web settings panel for project Python environments. It adopts or creates .venv_local/python and runs commands with project python and pip. It detects runtime markers and prepares environment variables. Use it to isolate dependencies and view workspace status.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:106-194","src/index.js:159-201","src/index.js:215-250"]}
